<html class="djot-viewer"><head><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><title>Diagrams</title><link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2032%2032%22%3E%3Cstyle%3E%40media%20(prefers-color-scheme%3A%20dark)%20%7B%20text%20%7B%20fill%3A%20%23fff%3B%20%7D%20%7D%3C%2Fstyle%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2216%22%20y%3D%2223%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%2CHelvetica%2Csans-serif%22%20font-size%3D%2228%22%20font-weight%3D%22bold%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20fill%3D%22%23000%22%3Edj%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E"></head><body><main class="djot"><section id="Diagrams">
<h1>Diagrams</h1>
<p>A flowchart:</p>
<pre><code class="language-mermaid">graph LR
  A[Start] --&gt; B{Choice}
  B --&gt;|yes| C[One]
  B --&gt;|no| D[Other]
</code></pre>
<p>A sequence diagram:</p>
<pre><code class="language-mermaid">sequenceDiagram
  Alice-&gt;&gt;Bob: Hello
  Bob--&gt;&gt;Alice: Hi
</code></pre>
<p>A diagram with a syntax error:</p>
<pre><code class="language-mermaid">graph LR
  A --&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>A diagram whose label contains HTML, whose onerror handler must not run:</p>
<pre><code class="language-mermaid">graph LR
  A["&lt;img src=x onerror=alert(1)&gt;"] --&gt; B
</code></pre>
</section>
</main></body></html>
